  fr: {
    title: 'Guerre commerciale Canada–É.-U. — Pupitre live, marchés et sondages — Vote-Scope',
    description:
      'La guerre tarifaire Canada–États-Unis, suivie en direct : tarifs américains de 50 % en vigueur, riposte dollar pour dollar d’Ottawa, cotes Polymarket et Kalshi, sondages Léger, Abacus et Angus Reid des deux côtés de la frontière, et l’écart de levier ACEUM entre Carney et Trump.',
    eyebrow: 'Vote-Scope · ACEUM · Pupitre guerre commerciale',
    headline: 'Le pupitre de la guerre commerciale.',
    dek:
      'Les pourparlers ont échoué. Les tarifs ont frappé. Cette page garde un instrument, un tableau de marchés et un mur de sondages sur le même écran — mis à jour chaque jour, sourcé ligne par ligne.',
    updated: 'Mis à jour',
    live: 'En direct',
    meterTitle: 'Écart de levier.',
    alertNext: 'Prochaine étape : riposte canadienne',
    factsEyebrow: 'Ce qui est réellement en vigueur',
    marketEyebrow: 'Ce que dit l’argent',
    marketTitle: 'Le tableau.',
    marketBody:
      'Cotes en direct de Polymarket et Kalshi. Marchés externes, portés comme contexte — aucun n’alimente l’écart de levier. Les carnets minces sont signalés, et un contrat ci-dessous se règle sur une question plus étroite que son titre le laisse croire.',
    ladderTitle: 'L’échelle du taux tarifaire',
    ladderSub: 'Kalshi · taux tarifaire général sur le Canada, 1ᵉʳ janvier 2027',
    ladderNote: 'Carnet mince — quelques centaines de contrats d’intérêt ouvert. À lire comme une forme, pas comme un prix.',
    pollsEyebrow: 'Ce que disent les publics',
    pollsTitle: 'Deux pays, un même dossier.',
    pollsBody:
      'Les Canadiens veulent moins de concessions que leur gouvernement n’en offre. Les Américains veulent moins de tarifs que leur président n’en impose. Les deux faits sont mesurés, et les deux dérangent la même politique.',
    pollsCanada: 'Canada',
    pollsUs: 'États-Unis',
    timelineEyebrow: 'Comment on en est arrivé là',
    timelineTitle: 'De la revue conjointe au 50 %.',
    quotesEyebrow: 'Les deux versions',
    quotesTitle: 'Même nuit, deux récits.',
    takesEyebrow: 'Notre lecture',
    takesTitle: 'Quatre choses que cette page affirme.',
    watchTitle: 'Ce qu’on surveille',
    methodEyebrow: 'Comment l’écart fonctionne',
    methodTitle: 'Un nombre, deux instruments.',
    methodBody:
      'L’écart, c’est l’Indice Bernache moins la force de Trump (100 − Indice canard boiteux). Il est tiré uniquement de nos deux instruments propriétaires — transparent et défendable. Tout le reste de cette page est du contexte, volontairement PAS fondu dans le nombre.',
    sidesEyebrow: 'Les deux oiseaux',
    sidesTitle: 'Chaque camp, son propre instrument.',
    canadaSub: 'Indice Bernache',
    usSub: 'Indice canard boiteux',
    strengthLabel: 'force résiduelle',
    openIndex: 'Ouvrir l’indice',
    contextEyebrow: 'Contexte bilatéral',
    contextTitle: 'Les signaux autour de la table.',
    contextBody: 'De la vraie data relationnelle — affichée comme contexte, hors du calcul de l’écart.',
    cadTitle: 'Huard (USD→CAD)',
    favTitle: 'Favourabilité du Canada aux É.-U.',
    viewMarket: 'Voir le marché',
    sourcesTitle: 'Le reportage derrière cette page',
    field: 'Terrain',
    sample: 'n',
    stale: 'Les cotes n’ont pas pu être rafraîchies — dernier tableau valide affiché.',
    embedSub: 'Marché externe — hors du calcul de l’écart.',
  },
  es: {
    title: 'Guerra comercial Canadá–EE. UU. — Mesa en vivo, mercados y encuestas — Vote-Scope',
    description:
      'La guerra arancelaria Canadá–Estados Unidos, en vivo: aranceles estadounidenses del 50 % en vigor, respuesta dólar por dólar de Ottawa, cuotas de Polymarket y Kalshi, encuestas de Léger, Abacus y Angus Reid a ambos lados de la frontera, y la brecha de ventaja del T-MEC entre Carney y Trump.',
    eyebrow: 'Vote-Scope · T-MEC · Mesa de guerra comercial',
    headline: 'La mesa de la guerra comercial.',
    dek:
      'Las negociaciones fracasaron. Los aranceles cayeron. Esta página mantiene un instrumento, un tablero de mercados y un muro de encuestas en la misma pantalla — actualizada a diario, con fuentes línea por línea.',
    updated: 'Actualizado',
    live: 'En vivo',
    meterTitle: 'Brecha de ventaja.',
    alertNext: 'Próximo paso: contra-aranceles canadienses',
    factsEyebrow: 'Lo que realmente está en vigor',
    marketEyebrow: 'Lo que dice el dinero',
    marketTitle: 'El tablero.',
    marketBody:
      'Precios en vivo de Polymarket y Kalshi. Mercados externos, como contexto — ninguno alimenta la brecha de ventaja. Los libros delgados están señalados, y un contrato abajo se resuelve sobre una pregunta más estrecha de lo que sugiere su título.',
    ladderTitle: 'La escalera de la tasa arancelaria',
    ladderSub: 'Kalshi · tasa arancelaria general sobre Canadá, 1 de enero de 2027',
    ladderNote: 'Libro delgado — unos cientos de contratos de interés abierto. Léase como forma, no como precio.',
    pollsEyebrow: 'Lo que dicen los públicos',
    pollsTitle: 'Dos países, un mismo expediente.',
    pollsBody:
      'Los canadienses quieren menos concesiones de las que ofrece su gobierno. Los estadounidenses quieren menos aranceles de los que impone su presidente. Ambos hechos están medidos, y ambos incomodan a la misma política.',
    pollsCanada: 'Canadá',
    pollsUs: 'Estados Unidos',
    timelineEyebrow: 'Cómo llegamos aquí',
    timelineTitle: 'De la revisión conjunta al 50 %.',
    quotesEyebrow: 'Las dos versiones',
    quotesTitle: 'Misma noche, dos relatos.',
    takesEyebrow: 'Nuestra lectura',
    takesTitle: 'Cuatro cosas que afirma esta página.',
    watchTitle: 'Lo que vigilamos',
    methodEyebrow: 'Cómo funciona la brecha',
    methodTitle: 'Un número, dos instrumentos.',
    methodBody:
      'La brecha es el Canada Goose Index menos la fuerza de Trump (100 − Lame-Duck Index). Derivada solo de nuestros dos instrumentos propios. Todo lo demás en esta página es contexto, deliberadamente fuera del cálculo.',
    sidesEyebrow: 'Las dos aves',
    sidesTitle: 'Cada lado, su instrumento.',
    canadaSub: 'Canada Goose Index',
    usSub: 'Lame-Duck Index',
    strengthLabel: 'fuerza residual',
    openIndex: 'Abrir índice',
    contextEyebrow: 'Contexto bilateral',
    contextTitle: 'Señales alrededor de la mesa.',
    contextBody: 'Datos relacionales reales — como contexto, fuera del cálculo de la brecha.',
    cadTitle: 'Loonie (USD→CAD)',
    favTitle: 'Favorabilidad de Canadá en EE. UU.',
    viewMarket: 'Ver mercado',
    sourcesTitle: 'El reportaje detrás de esta página',
    field: 'Campo',
    sample: 'n',
    stale: 'No se pudieron actualizar las cuotas — se muestra el último tablero válido.',
    embedSub: 'Mercado externo — fuera del cálculo de la brecha.',
  },
} as const;

const t = copy[locale] ?? copy.en;
const canonical = `https://vote-scope.com${canonicalPath}`;
const sides = data.sides;
const ctx = data.context_signals ?? {};
const war = data.war_status;
const board = data.markets?.board ?? [];
const editorial = data.editorial;
const canadaHref = locale === 'fr' ? sides.canada?.href_fr : sides.canada?.href_en;
const usHref = locale === 'fr' ? sides.us?.href_fr : sides.us?.href_en;
const gapLabel = showdownLabel(data.showdown, locale);
const licenseHref = `https://vote-scope.com/${locale === 'fr' ? 'fr/conditions' : locale === 'es' ? 'es/terminos' : 'en/terms'}/`;

const intlLocale = locale === 'fr' ? 'fr-CA' : locale === 'es' ? 'es-ES' : 'en-CA';
const thisYear = new Date().getFullYear();
const dayMonth = (iso: string) => {
  if (!iso) return '—';
  const date = new Date(`${iso}T12:00:00`);
  // Contracts run years out — a bare "Oct 15" on a 2029 market misleads.
  const withYear = date.getFullYear() !== thisYear;
  return date.toLocaleDateString(intlLocale, {
    month: 'short',
    day: 'numeric',
    ...(withYear ? { year: 'numeric' } : {}),
  });
};
const fullDate = (iso: string) =>
  iso
    ? new Date(`${iso}T12:00:00`).toLocaleDateString(intlLocale, { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })
    : '—';

/* The board arrives as one flat list. The Kalshi tariff-rate ladder is three
 * markets that only mean something read together, so it gets pulled out and
 * rendered as a single object. */
const ladder = board.filter((m) => m.group === 'ladder');
const cards = board.filter((m) => m.group !== 'ladder');
const featuredSlug = cards.find((m) => m.venue === 'polymarket' && m.featured)?.slug;

const usd = (value?: number) =>
  typeof value === 'number' && value > 0
    ? `$${value >= 1000 ? `${Math.round(value / 1000)}k` : Math.round(value)}`
    : null;

const marketMeta = (m: MarketCard) => {
  const bits: string[] = [];
  const volume = usd(m.volume_usd);
  if (volume) bits.push(`vol ${volume}`);
  if (typeof m.open_interest === 'number' && m.open_interest > 0) {
    bits.push(`OI ${usd(m.open_interest)}`);
  }
  if (m.closes) bits.push(`→ ${dayMonth(m.closes)}`);
  return bits.join(' · ');
};

const pollFirm = (p: PollCard) =>
  (locale === 'fr' ? p.firm_fr : locale === 'es' ? p.firm_es : undefined) ?? p.firm;

const pollMeta = (p: PollCard) => {
  const bits = [`${t.field} ${dayMonth(p.field_start)}–${dayMonth(p.field_end)}`];
  if (p.n) bits.push(`${t.sample} = ${p.n.toLocaleString(intlLocale)}`);
  if (p.moe) bits.push(`${p.moe} %`);
  return bits.join(' · ');
};

const alternates = {
  en: 'https://vote-scope.com/en/indexes/cusma-showdown/',
  fr: 'https://vote-scope.com/fr/indexes/cusma-showdown/',
  es: 'https://vote-scope.com/es/indexes/cusma-showdown/',
};

const jsonLd = [
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'Dataset',
    name: 'CUSMA Showdown — leverage gap, trade-war market board and polling',
    keywords:
      'CUSMA, USMCA, Canada US trade war, tariffs, Section 338, Mark Carney, Donald Trump, Canada Goose Index, Lame-Duck Index, Polymarket, Kalshi, Léger, Abacus Data, Angus Reid',
    description: t.description,
    creator: { '@type': 'Person', name: 'Kim Leclerc', url: 'https://kimleclerc.ca' },
    publisher: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Vote-Scope', url: 'https://vote-scope.com' },
    url: canonical,
    isAccessibleForFree: true,
    license: licenseHref,
    temporalCoverage: `${data.timeline?.[0]?.date ?? '2026-07-01'}/..`,
    distribution: {
      '@type': 'DataDownload',
      contentUrl: 'https://vote-scope.com/web_data/cusma-showdown/latest.json',
      encodingFormat: 'application/json',
    },
  },
  {
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
    itemListElement: [
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Vote-Scope', item: `https://vote-scope.com/${locale}/` },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: locale === 'fr' ? 'Indices' : locale === 'es' ? 'Índices' : 'Indexes', item: `https://vote-scope.com/${locale}/indexes` },
      { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'CUSMA Showdown', item: canonical },
    ],
  },
];

if (war) {
  jsonLd.push({
    '@context': 'https://schema.org',
    '@type': 'FAQPage',
    mainEntity: (data.timeline ?? []).slice(-3).map((entry) => ({
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: pick(entry, 'title', locale),
      acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: pick(entry, 'body', locale) },
    })),
  } as never);
}

const cad = ctx.cad_usd;
const fav = ctx.canada_favourability;
const tariff = ctx.tariff_market;
const favNote = fav ? (locale === 'fr' ? fav.note_fr : fav.note_en) : '';
const delta = data.showdown.delta_7d;
const deltaArrow = typeof delta === 'number' ? (delta > 0 ? '▲' : delta < 0 ? '▼' : '—') : '—';
const stickingPoints = war ? pickList(war, 'sticking_points', locale) : [];
const watchList = editorial ? pickList(editorial, 'watch', locale) : [];
---

<EditorialLayout
  title={t.title}
  description={t.description}
  canonical={canonical}
  lang={locale}
  currentPage="indexes"
  ogImage={"https://vote-scope.com/og/cusma-showdown.png"}
  alternates={alternates}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  {war && (
    <aside class="tw-alert" role="status">
      <div class="container tw-alert-inner">
        <span class="tw-alert-tag">{t.live}</span>
        <strong>{pick(war, 'headline', locale)}</strong>
        <span>{t.updated} {fullDate(data.meta.as_of_date ?? war.since)}</span>
        <span class="tw-alert-next">{t.alertNext} · {fullDate('2026-09-08')}</span>
      </div>
    </aside>
  )}

  <article class="lame-duck-page">
    <header class="lame-duck-hero container">
      <div class="lame-duck-hero-copy">
        <p class="lame-duck-kicker">{t.eyebrow}</p>
        <h1 class="lame-duck-title">{t.headline}</h1>
        <p class="lame-duck-dek">{t.dek}</p>
        {war && (
          <p class="lame-duck-dek">{pick(war, 'standfirst', locale)}</p>
        )}
        <div class="lame-duck-meta">
          <span>{t.updated} {data.computed.asOfLabel}</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span>v{data.meta.version ?? '2.0'}</span>
          <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
          <span>{data.computed.dataQualityLabel[locale] ?? data.computed.dataQualityLabel.en}</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lame-duck-actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="#markets">{t.marketEyebrow} ↓</a>
          <a class="btn-outline" href="#polls">{t.pollsEyebrow} ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside id="meter" class="lame-duck-meter-card" aria-label={gapLabel}>
        <div class="lame-duck-meter-head">
          <div>
            <h2>{t.meterTitle}</h2>
            <p>{gapLabel} · {deltaArrow} {typeof delta === 'number' ? Math.abs(delta).toFixed(1) : '—'}</p>
          </div>
          <span>LIVE</span>
        </div>
        <CusmaTugOfWar
          gap={data.showdown.gap}
          zones={data.zones}
          leader={data.showdown.leader}
          label={gapLabel}
          locale={locale}
          embedPath={`/${locale}/embed/cusma-showdown`}
          client:visible
        />
      </aside>
    </header>

    {war && (
      <section class="content-band" id="in-force">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.factsEyebrow}</p>
          <div class="tw-facts">
            {war.facts.map((fact) => (
              <article class={`tw-fact is-${fact.tone ?? 'neutral'}`}>
                <span>{pick(fact, 'label', locale)}</span>
                <strong>
                  {locale === 'en' ? (fact.value_en ?? fact.value) : locale === 'es' ? (fact.value_es ?? fact.value) : fact.value}
                </strong>
                <p>{pick(fact, 'note', locale)}</p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          {stickingPoints.length > 0 && (
            <ul class="tw-watch" style="max-width:820px">
              {stickingPoints.map((point, index) => (
                <li><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span style="color:var(--ink-2);font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;letter-spacing:0">{point}</span></li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          )}
        </div>
      </section>
    )}

    {editorial && (
      <section class="tw-stance" id="stance">
        <div class="container tw-stance-inner">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">{pick(editorial, 'stance_label', locale)}</p>
            <h2>{t.takesEyebrow}</h2>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p>{pick(editorial, 'stance', locale)}</p>
            <footer>{editorial.byline} · {fullDate(editorial.updated)}</footer>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    )}

    <section class="content-band" id="markets">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.marketEyebrow}</p>
        <div class="content-grid-2">
          <div><h2>{t.marketTitle}</h2></div>
          <div><p>{t.marketBody}</p></div>
        </div>

        {data.markets?.stale && <p class="note-card" style="margin-top:20px;max-width:680px">{t.stale}</p>}

        <div class="tw-board">
          {cards.map((m) => (
            <article class={`tw-market${m.featured ? ' is-featured' : ''}`}>
              <header>
                <span class={`tw-venue${m.thin ? ' is-thin' : ''}`}>
                  {m.venue === 'kalshi' ? 'Kalshi' : 'Polymarket'}{m.thin ? ' · thin' : ''}
                </span>
              </header>
              <h3>{pick(m, 'question', locale)}</h3>
              <div class="tw-prob">
                <b>{m.prob}%</b>
                <i>{locale === 'fr' ? 'implicite' : locale === 'es' ? 'implícita' : 'implied'}</i>
              </div>
              <div class="tw-gauge"><span style={`width:${Math.max(1, Math.min(100, m.prob))}%`}></span></div>
              {pick(m, 'reading', locale) && (
                <p class={m.caveat ? 'is-caveat' : undefined}>
                  {pick(m, 'reading', locale)}
                </p>
              )}
              <footer>
                <span>{marketMeta(m)}</span>
                <a href={m.event_url ?? m.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">{t.viewMarket} ↗</a>
              </footer>
            </article>
          ))}

          {ladder.length > 0 && (
            <section class="tw-ladder">
              <span class="tw-venue">Kalshi</span>
              <h3>{t.ladderTitle}</h3>
              <p style="margin:0;color:var(--ink-3);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px">{t.ladderSub}</p>
              <dl class="tw-ladder-rows">
                {ladder.map((step) => (
                  <div class="tw-ladder-row">
                    <dt>{pick(step, 'question', locale)}</dt>
                    <dd><div class="tw-gauge"><span style={`width:${Math.max(1, Math.min(100, step.prob))}%`}></span></div></dd>
                    <dd class="tw-ladder-pct">{step.prob}%</dd>
                  </div>
                ))}
              </dl>
              <p style="margin:14px 0 0;color:var(--ink-2);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6">{t.ladderNote}</p>
            </section>
          )}
        </div>

        {featuredSlug && (
          <div style="margin-top:26px;max-width:680px">
            <PolymarketEmbed
              slug={featuredSlug}
              title={t.marketEyebrow}
              subtitle={t.embedSub}
              lang={locale}
              eventUrl={cards.find((m) => m.slug === featuredSlug)?.event_url}
            />
          </div>
        )}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-band" id="polls">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.pollsEyebrow}</p>
        <div class="content-grid-2">
          <div><h2>{t.pollsTitle}</h2></div>
          <div><p>{t.pollsBody}</p></div>
        </div>

        <div class="tw-polls">
          {(['canada', 'us'] as const).map((sideKey) => (
            <div class="tw-poll-col">
              <p class="eyebrow">{sideKey === 'canada' ? t.pollsCanada : t.pollsUs}</p>
              {(data.polls?.[sideKey] ?? []).map((poll) => (
                <article class="tw-poll">
                  <span>{pollFirm(poll)}</span>
                  <h3>{pick(poll, 'headline', locale)}</h3>
                  <em>{pick(poll, 'question', locale)}</em>
                  <dl class="tw-bars">
                    {poll.results.map((row) => (
                      <div class={`tw-bar is-${row.tone ?? 'neutral'}`}>
                        <dt>
                          {pick(row, 'label', locale)}
                          <span><i style={`width:${Math.max(1, Math.min(100, row.pct))}%`}></i></span>
                        </dt>
                        <dd>{row.pct}%</dd>
                      </div>
                    ))}
                  </dl>
                  {pick(poll, 'note', locale) && (
                    <p>{pick(poll, 'note', locale)}</p>
                  )}
                  <footer>
                    {pollMeta(poll)} · <a href={poll.source_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{pollFirm(poll)} ↗</a>
                  </footer>
                </article>
              ))}
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {editorial && (
      <section class="content-band" id="read">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.takesEyebrow}</p>
          <div class="content-grid-2">
            <div><h2>{t.takesTitle}</h2></div>
            <div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tw-takes">
            {editorial.takes.map((take) => (
              <article class="tw-take">
                <h3>{pick(take, 'title', locale)}</h3>
                <p>{pick(take, 'body', locale)}</p>
              </article>
            ))}
          </div>
          {watchList.length > 0 && (
            <>
              <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:34px">{t.watchTitle}</p>
              <ul class="tw-watch">
                {watchList.map((item, index) => (
                  <li><span>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</span><span style="color:var(--ink-2);font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;letter-spacing:0">{item}</span></li>
                ))}
              </ul>
            </>
          )}
        </div>
      </section>
    )}

    {war && war.quotes?.length > 0 && (
      <section class="content-band" id="accounts">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.quotesEyebrow}</p>
          <div class="content-grid-2">
            <div><h2>{t.quotesTitle}</h2></div>
            <div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="tw-quotes">
            {war.quotes.map((quote) => (
              <figure class={`tw-quote${quote.side === 'us' ? ' is-us' : ''}`}>
                <blockquote>« {pick(quote, 'text', locale)} »</blockquote>
                <cite>{quote.speaker} · {pick(quote, 'role', locale)}</cite>
                <p>{pick(quote, 'context', locale)}</p>
              </figure>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    )}

    {(data.timeline?.length ?? 0) > 0 && (
      <section class="content-band" id="timeline">
        <div class="container">
          <p class="eyebrow">{t.timelineEyebrow}</p>
          <div class="content-grid-2">
            <div><h2>{t.timelineTitle}</h2></div>
            <div></div>
          </div>
          <ol class="tw-timeline">
            {data.timeline.map((entry) => (
              <li class={entry.tag === 'live' ? 'is-live' : entry.tag === 'ahead' ? 'is-ahead' : undefined}>
                <time datetime={entry.date}>{fullDate(entry.date)}</time>
                <h3>{pick(entry, 'title', locale)}</h3>
                <p>{pick(entry, 'body', locale)}</p>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>
    )}

    <section class="content-band" id="sides">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.sidesEyebrow}</p>
        <div class="content-grid-2">
          <div><h2>{t.sidesTitle}</h2></div>
          <div><p>{t.methodBody}</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="lame-duck-stats" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
          <article style={`border-left:4px solid ${sides.canada?.color ?? '#2f6fb0'};padding-left:1rem`}>
            <p>{sides.canada?.name} · {t.canadaSub}</p>
            <strong class="is-blue">{sides.canada?.score?.toFixed(1)}<span>/100</span></strong>
            <em>{showdownLabel({ label_en: sides.canada?.label_en, label_fr: sides.canada?.label_fr }, locale)}</em>
            {canadaHref && <a class="btn-outline" href={canadaHref} style="margin-top:.6rem;display:inline-block">{t.openIndex} ↗</a>}
          </article>
          <article style={`border-left:4px solid ${sides.us?.color ?? '#c94040'};padding-left:1rem`}>
            <p>{sides.us?.name} · {t.usSub}</p>
            <strong class="is-red">{sides.us?.strength?.toFixed(1)}<span>/100</span></strong>
            <em>{t.strengthLabel} · LDI {sides.us?.ldi?.toFixed(1)}</em>
            {usHref && <a class="btn-outline" href={usHref} style="margin-top:.6rem;display:inline-block">{t.openIndex} ↗</a>}
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-band" id="context">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.contextEyebrow}</p>
        <div class="content-grid-2">
          <div><h2>{t.contextTitle}</h2></div>
          <div><p>{t.contextBody}</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="lame-duck-stats" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
          {cad && (
            <article>
              <p>{t.cadTitle}</p>
              <strong>{cad.value.toFixed(4)}</strong>
              <em>{cad.source} · {cad.as_of}</em>
            </article>
          )}
          {fav && (
            <article>
              <p>{t.favTitle}</p>
              <strong>{fav.value}%</strong>
              <em>{fav.source} · {fav.as_of}</em>
            </article>
          )}
          {tariff && (
            <article>
              <p>{t.marketEyebrow}</p>
              <strong style="font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.3">{locale === 'fr' ? tariff.label_fr : tariff.label_en}</strong>
              {tariff.market_url && <a class="btn-outline" href={tariff.market_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-top:.6rem;display:inline-block">{t.viewMarket} ↗</a>}
            </article>
          )}
        </div>
        {favNote && <p class="note-card" style="margin-top:1.25rem;max-width:680px">{favNote}</p>}
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-band" id="methodology">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">{t.methodEyebrow}</p>
        <div class="content-grid-2">
          <div><h2>{t.methodTitle}</h2></div>
          <div><p>{t.methodBody}</p></div>
        </div>
        {war && war.sources?.length > 0 && (
          <>
            <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:34px">{t.sourcesTitle}</p>
            <ul class="tw-sources">
              {war.sources.map((source) => (
                <li><a href={source.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{source.label} ↗</a></li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </>
        )}
      </div>
    </section>

    <NewsletterCta lang={locale} placement="cusma-trade-war" />
  </article>
</EditorialLayout>
